  "description": "CAQWAW crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C56 H58 Eu2 N8 O36 Si8 Tb2 2-,2(C8 H20 N1 1+),4(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Eu1 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.712-3.760 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 105.57-107.50°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [NEt4]2[(Ph4Si4O8)2(Tb2Eu2)(NO3)6(EtOH)2(MeCN)2]·4(MeCN). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 6 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula). Article name explicitly identifies I(II), I(II).",
